# BestStrat Strategic Execution Framework

## Before Launch
- Priority is clearly defined
- Outcome is measurable
- Executive sponsor is identified
- Clear ownership and accountability are established
- Cross-functional dependencies are identified and managed

## During Execution
- Progress is reviewed regularly
- Risks are visible
- Decisions are documented
- Stakeholders are aligned
- Changes are communicated

## After Review
- Results are measured
- Lessons learned are captured
- Next actions are assigned
- Accountability is maintained
